n sean tus necesidades de simulaci\u00f3n. \n\nAjusta tu punter\u00eda \u00a1y prep\u00e1rate para ser evaluado dentro de la misma simulaci\u00f3n!", "short_description": "Con Simulador de extintores VR podr\u00e1s experimentar en primera persona el uso de 4 diferentes extintores (polvo seco, CO2, Sodio y Potasio) en un laboratorio de materiales y en diferentes escenarios del mundo real, donde podr\u00e1s ajustar la dificultad seg\u00fan sean tus necesidades de simulaci\u00f3n. \n\nAjusta tu punter\u00eda \u00a1y prep\u00e1rate para ser evaluado dentro de la misma simulaci\u00f3n!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "622065660623903", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Fire Extinguisher Simulator VR", "keywords": ["incendio", "extintor", "otec", "capacitaci\u00f3n", "simulador"], "long_description": "With Fire Extinguisher Simulator VR you can experience first-hand the use of 4 different fire extinguishers (dry powder, CO2, Sodium and Potassium) in a materials laboratory and in different real-world scenarios, where you can adjust the difficulty according to your simulation needs.\n\nAdjust your aim and get ready to be evaluated within the same simulation!", "short_description": "With Fire Extinguisher Simulator VR you can experience first-hand the use of 4 different fire extinguishers (dry powder, CO2, Sodium and Potassium) in a materials laboratory and in different real-world scenarios, where you can adjust the difficulty according to your simulation needs.\n\nAdjust your aim and get ready to be evaluated within the same simulation!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://virtualizar.cl/politica-de-privacidad-realidad-virtual/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://virtualizar.cl/legal", "publisher_name": "Virtualizar SPA", "support_website_url": "https://virtualizar.cl/contacto/", "website_url": "https://virtualizar.cl/", "category": null, "comfort_rating